# Twenty levels instead of GMS's ten, with every ladder ending where GMS's does:
# 40 status resistance, 40% elemental, 250% DEF and +20 attack.
#
# The guard is a chance to block the whole hit instead of reducing it, which is
# what dodge_chance is. The stun a guard causes is dropped: a guard only blocks
# the hit, and nothing acts on the monster that attacked. Of what is left, only
# the attack and the guard are worth anything: the two resistances have nothing
# to resist, and DEF is already past what it can cancel. All of it needs the off
# hand, which for a White Knight can only be a rosary.
name: "Shield Mastery"
description:
  "Increases Elemental Resistance, Abnormal Status Resistance, DEF, and "
  "Attack Power when a secondary weapon is equipped, and gives you a chance "
  "to guard."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_WHITE_KNIGHT skill_order: 6 }
max_level: 20
requires_secondary: true
base {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
  def_pct: 1.17
  attack: 1
  dodge_chance: 0.02
}
per_level {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
  def_pct: 0.07
  attack: 1
  dodge_chance: 0.02
}
